  "prefLabel": "Bea 303.08 Public Relations Campaigns",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 303.08 Public Relations Campaigns. In addition to the project requirements in Bea 303.02 above, applications for the public relations campaigns shall:\n\n(a) Include the statement “for further information about New Hampshire, visit visitnh.gov”, if print or electronic press release; and\n\n(b) Include a communication campaign plan outlining messaging, distribution channels, and anticipated outcomes.\n\nSource. #13270, eff 9-30-21; ss by #14624, eff 7-7-26, EXPIRES: 7-7-36 (formerly Bea 303.05)",
